            <ArticleTitle>Symptomatic intraspinal pneumocoele resulting from closed head injury.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>248-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Intraspinal pneumocoele is rarely associated with closed head injury. We describe a case of intra-spinal pneumocoele following a closed head injury. We believe this to be the first case presenting with radicular symptoms.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
